  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-900 via-orange-950 to-stone-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>🍁</span><span>2026年 秋〜初冬旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      秋の紅葉見頃シーズンや連休の温泉宿は早期割引プランが人気です。希望の日程はお早めの空室チェックが安心です。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F193449%2F193449.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    👉 岩手県のおすすめ温泉旅館＆ホテルランキングの自慢の温泉＆空室状況を見る →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【岩手県の温泉完全ガイド】名湯ランキング＆露天風呂付きおすすめ旅館10選</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">岩手県が誇る風情ある温泉街や隠れ家温泉リゾート。泉質の特徴や美肌効果、四季折々の絶景を楽しめる露天風呂、地元岩手県の旬の食材（前沢牛・盛岡冷麺・わんこそば・三陸産カキなど）を味わえる極上宿を紹介します。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 岩手県の温泉エリアとおすすめポイント</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-2\">岩手県の豊かな自然に包まれながら楽しむ名湯ステイ。記念日のお祝いから週末の癒やし旅まで、心に残る上質な時間を過ごせます。</p>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs text-amber-950\">\n    <strong>注目の温泉・宿泊エリア：</strong> 花巻・つなぎ・鶯宿・夏油・安比高原温泉（紅葉露天・雪見風呂・前沢牛・いわて短角牛会席）</div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 岩手県の主要エリア別おすすめ温泉宿</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n            <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-amber-500 font-bold\">♨️</span> 盛岡・花巻温泉周辺エリアの温泉・宿\n            </h4>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">岩手県を代表する観光名所・絶景スポット・名湯が凝縮された一番人気エリア。</p>\n            <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-stone-50 p-3 rounded-xl\"><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F84786%2F84786.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>岩手の名湯　侍の湯　おぼない</strong></a>（二戸市金田一湯田43-5 ／ 評価 ⭐4.79・目安 ¥17,800〜）</li><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F13482%2F13482.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>花巻温泉　佳松園</strong></a>（花巻市湯本第1地割125-2 ／ 評価 ⭐4.69・目安 ¥18,700〜）</li><li><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F129427%2F129427.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"underline hover:text-amber-700\"><strong>湯川温泉　山人－ｙａｍａｄｏ－</strong></a>（和賀郡西和賀町52-71-10 ／ 評価 ⭐4.67・目安 ¥30,764〜）</li></ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">💡 岩手県の温泉宿選び＆予約のコツ</h3>\n<ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n  <li><strong>客室露天風呂・貸切風呂：</strong> プライベートな空間で温泉を満喫したいカップル・ファミリーに大人気</li>\n  <li><strong>料理自慢の宿：</strong> 岩手県ならではの郷土料理やブランド牛、新鮮な山海の幸を堪能できるプランを選択</li>\n  <li><strong>お得な予約タイミング：</strong> 楽天トラベルの「5と0のつく日」や限定クーポンを活用してお得に予約</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏆 岩手県の温泉旅館・ホテルおすすめランキング10選【楽天トラベル公式データ】</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/84786/84786.jpg\" alt=\"岩手の名湯　侍の湯　おぼない\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第1位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">岩手の名湯　侍の湯　おぼない</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 岩手県二戸市金田一湯田43-5 ｜ 🚃 金田一温泉駅よりバスで約７分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.79（338件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥17,800〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">八戸港から直仕入れる魚介類。築８０年の昭和レトロと380年の湯宿</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F84786%2F84786.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/13482/13482.jpg\" alt=\"花巻温泉　佳松園\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第2位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">花巻温泉　佳松園</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 岩手県花巻市湯本第1地割125-2 ｜ 🚃 花巻IC：右折後直進4km（5分）、JR新花巻駅・JR花巻駅：無料送迎バス20分（定時運行・完全予約制）</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.69（1108件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥18,700〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">とろとろの湯と心に残るおもてなし。特別な日を佳松園で過ごす愉しみ。花巻ICよりわずか5分の別世界。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F13482%2F13482.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/129427/129427.jpg\" alt=\"湯川温泉　山人－ｙａｍａｄｏ－\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第3位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">湯川温泉　山人－ｙａｍａｄｏ－</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 岩手県和賀郡西和賀町52-71-10 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ北上線「ほっとゆだ駅」から車で約7分／秋田自動車道「湯田ＩＣ」からお車で約13分／湯けむりタクシー毎日4便乗り合い制</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.67（215件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥30,764〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">自然の息づかいに耳を傾ける―ここは極上のヒーリングリゾート。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F129427%2F129427.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/164790/164790.jpg\" alt=\"松川温泉　峡雲荘\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第4位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">松川温泉　峡雲荘</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 岩手県八幡平市松尾寄木　松川温泉 ｜ 🚃 盛岡駅→バス松川温泉行き約１１０分松川温泉徒歩約０分（大人片道1350円）／東北自動車道　松尾八幡平ＩＣより車で約２５分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.66（190件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥18,000〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">自然豊かな八幡平の原生林に囲まれた古民家風の秘湯の宿。源泉掛け流しの硫黄泉が心と体を癒します。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F164790%2F164790.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/56830/56830.jpg\" alt=\"盛岡つなぎ温泉　四季亭\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第5位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">盛岡つなぎ温泉　四季亭</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 岩手県盛岡市繋湯の館137 ｜ 🚃 ＪＲ盛岡駅より車で約２５分、路線バスで約４０分（駅からの送迎サービスはございません）</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.64（517件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥14,300〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">日本の季節を愛でるお宿、四季折々に心づくしのおもてなし。季を彩る和風旅館、つなぎ温泉四季亭へどうぞ。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F56830%2F56830.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/72032/72032.jpg\" alt=\"祭畤温泉　かみくら\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-[10px] rounded-md\">第6位</span>\n          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">祭畤温泉　かみくら</h4>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">📍 岩手県一ノ関市厳美町祭畤32 ｜ 🚃 【公共交通】タクシーのみ　【乗用車】一関駅よりお車にて約45分／世界遺産「平泉」へ約35分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.63（352件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥21,780〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">全7室のリトリート宿。泡付き温泉と着物で愉しむJapanese French。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F72032%2F72032.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n  